gantt
    title LiFi-PV Production Transition - 52 Week Roadmap
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %b %Y
    todayMarker off

    section Phase 1 - Architecture and PCB
    System architecture freeze           :p1a, 2026-07-06, 2w
    Dual-processor partitioning spec     :p1b, after p1a, 1w
    TIA redesign OPA380 100k             :p1c, after p1a, 2w
    Optical subsystem spec               :p1d, after p1a, 2w
    Production component sourcing        :p1e, after p1b, 3w
    4-layer PCB schematic capture        :p1f, after p1c, 3w
    Mixed-signal PCB layout              :p1g, after p1f, 3w
    PCB fabrication and SMT assembly     :p1h, after p1g, 3w
    GATE 1 Rev A boards received         :milestone, m1, after p1h, 0d

    section Phase 2 - Firmware and Network
    STM32H7 OOK decoder firmware         :p2a, 2026-08-17, 5w
    Manchester encoding and FEC codec    :p2b, after p2a, 3w
    ESP32-S3 OTA dual-partition boot     :p2c, 2026-08-17, 4w
    TinyML model port to ESP32-S3        :p2d, after p2c, 3w
    MQTT QoS 1 and flash ring buffer     :p2e, after p2c, 2w
    ChirpStack LoRaWAN server setup      :p2f, 2026-09-14, 3w
    SX1302 gateway commissioning         :p2g, after p2f, 2w
    Node firmware integration            :p2h, after p2b, 3w
    GATE 2 Firmware feature-complete     :milestone, m2, after p2h, 0d

    section Phase 3 - Alpha Validation
    Rev A board bring-up smoke test      :p3a, after m1, 2w
    TIA characterization BW noise        :p3b, after p3a, 2w
    Hybrid receiver test 30m range       :p3c, after p3a, 3w
    MPPT charging validation BQ25570     :p3d, after p3a, 2w
    LoRaWAN capacity stress test 500 sim :p3e, after p2g, 3w
    Environmental chamber thermal humid  :p3f, after p3b, 2w
    Full system integration bench test   :p3g, after p3c, 2w
    Rev B PCB design corrections         :p3h, after p3g, 3w
    GATE 3 Alpha validation passed       :milestone, m3, after p3h, 0d

    section Phase 4 - Beta Field Test
    Rev B PCB fabrication 50-unit batch  :p4a, after m3, 4w
    IP67 enclosure manufacturing         :p4b, after m3, 3w
    20-node field deployment Cairo       :p4c, after p4a, 2w
    Optical alignment commissioning      :p4d, after p4c, 1w
    8-week continuous operation test      :p4e, after p4d, 8w
    BER channel characterization data    :p4f, after p4d, 6w
    Publication manuscript drafting       :p4g, after p4f, 4w
    GATE 4 99.9 pct uptime achieved      :milestone, m4, after p4e, 0d

    section Phase 5 - Enterprise Deployment
    Contract manufacturer engagement     :p5a, after m4, 2w
    500-unit production run              :p5b, after p5a, 6w
    CE FCC certification process         :p5c, after m4, 8w
    Multi-site gateway infrastructure    :p5d, after p5b, 3w
    3-farm deployment commissioning      :p5e, after p5d, 4w
    Open-source release publication      :p5f, after p4g, 2w
    GATE 5 Enterprise system live        :milestone, m5, after p5e, 0d
